Group:Contact:OR(OPEN, CLOSED) gDoorsSensors
Group:DateTime:MAX gDoorsLast
Group:Switch:OR(ON, OFF) gDoorsTimers

Contact vFrontDoor "Front Door [%s]" (gDoorsSensors)
DateTime vFrontDoor_LastUpdate "Last update [%1$tm/%1$td %1$tH:%1$tM]" (gDoorsLast)
Switch vFrontDoor_Timer { expire="1h,command=OFF" } (gDoorsTimers)
